TITLE H Mart, 2023 | The checkout, before barbecue at Jason's
PAUSE 3
ERIC: Yo, what was the total?
MOMO: It's like three hundred and twelve dollars. [1.5]
EMOTE JASON dots 5
PAUSE 5
JASON: Hmm. [1.5]
ERIC: You okay there?
JASON (open): Dang. That's a lot of money. That's like thirty chipotle bowls.
ERIC: I mean, you didn't have to buy five short ribs.
JASON: Yeah. I know. I just didn't think it would add up like that.
PAUSE 4
ERIC: How about we put it this way. We're not buying food, we're buying the memories. [1.8]
JASON: Ah. [1.4]
JASON (smile): I see. That's a nice way to think about it.
MOMO: It's ok, Eric and I can split it.
JASON: No no. You know, memories are important. We can split it.
PAUSE 3
CARD Ten people came. One of them was Daniel.
